# Minimal interactive Bash startup for MSYS2 / Windows.
#
# This file is intended as a self-contained replacement for the current
# modular rc/ startup on Windows.  It preserves the effective interactive
# settings that matter day-to-day on the PF5S26BT / SNCF setup, while
# avoiding startup-time cache generation and subprocess-heavy helpers.
#
# Deliberate omissions:
# - no env-cache generation or BASH_ENV management
# - no prompt-time git/date/df subprocesses
# - no PowerShell / pwsh chcp invocation
# - no bash-completion bootstrap or script-generated completions
# - no GNUstep / shelly / rbenv / pyenv / flightgear optional loaders
# - no sourcing of secret-bearing files beyond authinfo

